==Battleground==
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Easter Duche]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**5 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

For {{4c}} difficulty, not much changes; [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] can solo the stage.

